<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 15:01:28 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Lumos NexCore 将机器人技能开发时间缩短至几天</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/lumos-nexcore-cuts-robot-skill-development-to-days</link><description>Lumos 声称，机器人技能的开发时间从几周缩短到几天。自 2025 年起，三菱电机已在中国工厂运行该系统。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/lumos-nexcore-cuts-robot-skill-development-to-days.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 15:01:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/lumos-nexcore-cuts-robot-skill-development-to-days</guid></item><item><title>大脑纹状体图谱</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/atlas-of-the-brains-striatum</link><description>大脑中称为纹状体的区域对于许多认知和运动功能至关重要，包括决策、运动控制、习惯形成和奖励处理。它还在成瘾中发挥作用，并受到亨廷顿舞蹈病、精神分裂症和其他疾病的显着影响。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/atlas-of-the-brains-striatum2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 14:46:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/atlas-of-the-brains-striatum</guid></item><item><title>美国宇航局局长：如何到达另一个恒星系统|贾里德·艾萨克曼</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nasa-chief-how-to-reach-another-star-system-jared-isaacman</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 14:31:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nasa-chief-how-to-reach-another-star-system-jared-isaacman</guid></item><item><title>小行星龙宫的尘埃揭示了氮缓慢浓缩成复杂分子的过程</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/asteroid-ryugus-dust-reveals-nitrogens-slow-concentration-into-complex-molecules</link><description>氮是构成生命基石的生物分子的关键成分。然而，作为一种未结合的气体，它更容易漂移到太空中，而不是将自己锁在固体化合物中，这使得天文学家很难追踪它在遥远的过去到达地球的旅程。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/asteroid-ryugus-dust-reveals-nitrogens-slow-concentration-into-complex-molecules2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 14:16:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/asteroid-ryugus-dust-reveals-nitrogens-slow-concentration-into-complex-molecules</guid></item><item><title>2025 年地球臭氧空洞小得出奇</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/earths-ozone-hole-was-surprisingly-small-in-2025</link><description>南极臭氧空洞正在显着改善。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/earths-ozone-hole-was-surprisingly-small-in-2025.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 14:01:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/earths-ozone-hole-was-surprisingly-small-in-2025</guid></item><item><title>原子有多小？ 🤯 放大到人类的头发！</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-small-is-an-atom-%f0%9f%a4%af-zooming-into-a-human-hair</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 13:46:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-small-is-an-atom-%f0%9f%a4%af-zooming-into-a-human-hair</guid></item><item><title>火箭实验室从新西兰发射日本地球观测雷达卫星</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/rocket-lab-launches-japanese-earth-observing-radar-satellite-from-new-zealand</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 13:31:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/rocket-lab-launches-japanese-earth-observing-radar-satellite-from-new-zealand</guid></item><item><title>WHO 1 级和 2 级脑膜瘤中 CD73 和 PD-L1 的表达：嘌呤能和免疫相关谱的探索性分析</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/cd73-and-pd-l1-expression-in-who-grade-1-and-grade-2-meningiomas-an-exploratory-analysis-of-purinergic-and-immune-related-profi